{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "1. On the Mac, open **System Settings**." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Auf dem Mac **Systemeinstellungen** öffnen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. On the Mac, open the KeystrokeQR menu → **“Pair Device…”**." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Am Mac das KeystrokeQR-Menü öffnen → **„Gerät koppeln…“**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Choose **Privacy & Security → Accessibility**." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. **Datenschutz & Sicherheit → Bedienungshilfen** wählen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. The Mac shows a **6-digit code** (valid for 90 seconds)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Der Mac zeigt einen **6-stelligen Code** (90 Sekunden gültig)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Enable **KeystrokeQR Host** in the list (add it with “+” if needed)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. **KeystrokeQR Host** in der Liste aktivieren (ggf. über „+“ hinzufügen)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. When your iPhone finds a new Mac, the pairing screen appears automatically — enter the code and tap **Pair**." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Findet das iPhone einen neuen Mac, erscheint automatisch der Pairing-Screen — Code eintippen, **Koppeln** antippen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. If the app was already running: quit it once and relaunch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. Falls die App schon lief: einmal beenden und neu starten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. Pairing is **one-time**: the shared key is stored securely in the keychain and used automatically for every future connection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. Das Pairing ist **einmalig**: Der gemeinsame Schlüssel wird sicher im Schlüsselbund gespeichert und bei jeder künftigen Verbindung automatisch verwendet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Über"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After this, all codes will be sent automatically again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Danach werden alle Codes wieder automatisch gesendet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Accessibility on the Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bedienungshilfen auf dem Mac erlauben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow camera access" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kamerazugriff erlauben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
