            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Weiter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disconnected – searching again…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Getrennt – suche erneut …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fertig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the code from the Mac menu “Pair Device…”:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Code aus dem Mac-Menü „Gerät koppeln…“ eingeben:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found Mac is running an outdated app – please update" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gefundener Mac läuft mit veralteter App – bitte aktualisieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hilfe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it works" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "So funktioniert’s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Introduction" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einführung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone and Mac are on the **same Wi-Fi** (or the same local network)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone und Mac sind im **gleichen WLAN** (bzw. gleichen lokalen Netzwerk)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone and Mac talk directly over your local Wi-Fi. Nothing goes through the cloud, and every connection is paired and end-to-end encrypted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone und Mac kommunizieren direkt über dein lokales WLAN. Nichts läuft über die Cloud, und jede Verbindung ist gekoppelt und Ende-zu-Ende verschlüsselt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KeystrokeQR needs two permissions to do its job:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KeystrokeQR benötigt für seine Aufgabe zwei Berechtigungen:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last scanned" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zuletzt gescannt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let’s go" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los geht’s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local network" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lokales Netzwerk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac not found." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac nicht gefunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac: Accessibility permission missing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac: Bedienungshilfen-Berechtigung fehlt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manage paired Macs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gekoppelte Macs verwalten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Mac — pair it once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Neuer Mac — bitte einmalig koppeln."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No camera access" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kein Kamerazugriff"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Mac paired yet. On the Mac, open the “Pair Device…” menu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noch kein Mac gekoppelt. Öffne auf dem Mac das Menü „Gerät koppeln…“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On your Mac, open the KeystrokeQR menu and choose “Pair Device…”. It shows a 6-digit code — type it here once when your iPhone finds the Mac. That’s it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffne am Mac das KeystrokeQR-Menü und wähle „Gerät koppeln…“. Es erscheint ein 6-stelliger Code — tippe ihn hier einmalig ein, sobald dein iPhone den Mac findet. Fertig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One-time pairing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einmaliges Koppeln (Pairing)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einstellungen öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open source on GitHub" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open Source auf GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the KeystrokeQR scanner." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffnet den KeystrokeQR-Scanner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the KeystrokeQR scanner and readies the camera." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffnet den KeystrokeQR-Scanner und macht die Kamera scharf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the KeystrokeQR scanner directly — even from the Lock Screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffnet den KeystrokeQR-Scanner direkt — auch vom Sperrbildschirm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
